Package: superv
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, libglib2.0-bin, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: xwayland, udev, kmod, appstream
Suggests: xdotool
Maintainer: Sacid Sezgin <noreply@localhost>
Description: SuperV - clipboard history on Super+V, by Sacid Sezgin
 SuperV keeps the last things you copied (text and images) and shows them
 in a small panel when you press Super+V. Picking an entry pastes it into
 the window you were working in. Entries can be pinned, searched and
 removed.
 .
 Developed by Sacid Sezgin.
 .
 Works on GNOME sessions under Wayland and X11 (Zorin OS, Ubuntu) and on
 Xfce.
